{
  "name": "ondra-emotion-express",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的情绪六态映射（手册 §3.2）：雀跃/软和/平静/蔫/炸毛/困，六态与宣传片 05 章完全一致、不得增删改名。同一个判定同时供 prompt / rhythm / tts 三处取用，语速 ±10%/−15%、主动额度 ±1、不朗读、贴纸概率等系数全仓只在本插件出现一次。只出参数不出文本——投影文本唯一归 ondra-emotion-project。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
